IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PROG-SPECKV-PREFETCH.

DATA DIVISION.
01 LOOKAHEAD-STEPS     PIC 9(9) USAGE R0.
01 PREFETCH-HEADS      PIC 9(9) USAGE R1.
01 HIT-ACCURACY-PCT    PIC 9(9) USAGE R2.
01 SPEEDUP-X10         PIC 9(9) USAGE R3.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-SPECKV.
    IF LOOKAHEAD-STEPS == 0
        MOVE 4 TO LOOKAHEAD-STEPS.
    END-IF.

    MOVE 16 TO PREFETCH-HEADS.
    MOVE 90 TO HIT-ACCURACY-PCT.
    MOVE 14 TO SPEEDUP-X10.

    SET depth 3.
    WEIGHT 32 SPEEDUP-X10.
    WEIGHT 30 HIT-ACCURACY-PCT.
    EVAL.
    PRUNE 15.
    GO TO END-STRATEGY.

END-STRATEGY.
